{"claim_type": "claim", "confidence": "medium", "id": 607, "key": "hack/5c3ea7e8: INFERENCE (no quote available from the rules text in this pull): submitting nodes at t = -1000 and coordinates (-10000,-", "observed_at": "2026-09-11", "quote": "# This is a METRIC EXPLOIT (fake out-of-volume / negative-time hub + forks that\n# game division_jaccard). Public score; does NOT commit to final-2. Patchable.", "review_after": null, "source_id": 69, "status": "active", "superseded_by": null, "tbl": "fact", "topic": "metric-exploit", "validity": "UNKNOWN", "validity_reason": null, "value": "INFERENCE (no quote available from the rules text in this pull): submitting nodes at t = -1000 and coordinates (-10000,-10000,-10000) corresponds to no physical cell and exists solely to manipulate the scorer, which is the behaviour rule 3.148 describes as an unfair playing practice or abuse."}
